[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-STD010
TITLE: Option, touch-and-go, stop-and-go, and low-approach cases
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall fly to the downwind, accept touch-and-go, and observe a later takeoff roll after the altitude has been below 80 feet. It shall accept stop-and-go and observe a rollout slower than 5 knots followed by another takeoff roll. It shall accept the option with the low-approach choice and stay at or above 150 feet before climbing. Acceptance is those three outcomes. The test file is apps/aircraft/tests/test_aircraft.py.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
This is the example test for the option family.
<<<
DAL: E
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Low-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The Aircraft CSCI is a simulation. It is not connected to a real aircraft or a live facility, and this record does not claim certification authority approval.
